          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Solve the initial value problem\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14066958/assets/5cc29f7492fded69b4100e10329c831cca0734a29966cd1aac2e8ad017636719.png)",
